{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/434","id":4472622498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSpI5QM8AAAABCpbNog","html_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/434","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/434.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/434.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/434","number":434,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prevent obsolete birth-chart results and delayed action updates","user":{"login":"zodiacs-org","id":289121529,"node_id":"U_kgDOETuk-Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289121529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org","html_url":"https://github.com/zodiacs-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Birth-chart edits and failed replacement calculations could leave an old chart visible, while delayed sharing, saved-profile context and focus callbacks could overwrite newer input. Bind each result and its later work to the input/run and applicable access that produced it. Clear stale derived output while preserving typed fields, ordinary retry, public positions, independent primary charts and explicitly requested saves that have already committed.\n\nThe source scope is four reviewed files plus a separate four-line CI step. The first freeze failed independent review; its three concrete reference/focus findings and original failures are retained. The corrected freeze prevents a delayed positions import from reviving a revoked saved-mine reference, an old controls retry from stealing focus, and an old save-close frame from touching a replacement prompt. The persistence call and numerical statements are unchanged. No date-interval activation, certainty policy, SDK/API/storage schema, locale copy, styles, navigation or Astrofolio changes.\n\nValidation:\n- Author134 focused tests and17 actual production-page browser groups pass.\n- Independent22 component controls,18 native save/profile controls,5 unmodified production-build controls and17 exact-driver portability cases pass. Native committed saves write exactly once; denied/prompt-only cases write zero.\n- Root normal build, check (1,042 files; zero errors/warnings), all4,965 tests/415files,17 native cases,12 existing sharing cases, Russian26-route+404 checks and exact-base scope pass. All18 fresh Phase1 captures are byte-identical to #431. Existing size limits pass; the engine stays23.3KB/25KB.\n- The original three macOS baseline-height failures persist before and after. Two initial chart images are byte-identical; reduced motion has one scored pixel at the unchanged0.1threshold (ratio7.30840290932903e-8, below the existing0.001budget), with equal dimensions. A fresh candidate repeat matches its first output exactly. The initial stricter byte-equality failure and all pixels are retained; no baseline, mask or tolerance changed. No cause or normal visual-gate pass is claimed for those original height failures.\n- The reviewed CI step runs the unchanged driver with a5-minute limit, existing pinned Chromium and existing artifact retention. No permission/secret/other-gate changes; hosted execution is pending.\n\nStacked on #431 exactabcf1a44e52040db79a369b49bc9b55d78099b22. Author patchSHA25632b7413f9fcce17b192fa9f3fe28847d6b6ec7bfccc39b4437fee60df44a8e9f; componentfea737333ea5df9a894dafa99de06cd1dcc8390f3bd43d9e627992b466dfa4d0. Durable identities/reviews/raw evidence: docs/platform/evidence/chart-result-ownership/; current shared checkpoint: docs/platform/STATUS.md.\n\nThis is an implemented/tested draft candidate; exact-source hosted CI/preview remain pending. No merge, npm publication, production deployment, human numerical/legal signoff or external adoption. SDK #5's hold and the separate Astrofolio verification release remain intact. Latest main79410401's scheduled Registry-only updates are untouched and must be retained during eventual main integration. The recorded skipped-date and whole-date coverage defects remain separate open work.\n","created_at":"2026-09-08T09:22:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T09:22:26Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e2ceea8b391765f6cdef857871a36ebaebc6d5f1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/434/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/434/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/434/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/statuses/c7b9eb4a769e39a46aebc0a5ecedcb9fc40949e3","head":{"label":"ZodiacsOfficial:codex/platform-chart-result-ownership","ref":"codex/platform-chart-result-ownership","sha":"c7b9eb4a769e39a46aebc0a5ecedcb9fc40949e3","user":{"login":"ZodiacsOfficial","id":289132375,"node_id":"O_kgDOETvPVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289132375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial","html_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/followers","follo